# Legacy RampBugFix adaptation

The optional RampBugFix core is adapted from Interesting-exe/CS2Fixes-RampbugFix
at commit dc9ad2ec896bf0818ffe01e839dba20ce4891fe5. That source is licensed under
GNU GPL version 3. Its README credits the original ramp-fix approach to zer0.
This repository's adaptation remains covered by GNU GPL version 3. It does not
include the legacy repository's bundled funchook copy and does not implement the
newer CS2KZ ramp algorithm.

